Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  对不起  你没给我什么合约啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, I'm sorry, You didn't give me any contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  我有  我还贴了一张随手贴写着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I did. I put a little Post-it on it that said:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"今天一定要寄出"  在"今天"下面划了三道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Must go out today," and I underlined "today" three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我还在角落画了一颗心  因为我不想太像上司\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then I put a little heart in the corner because I didn't wanna seem to bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  你没有给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm telling you, You never gave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们到办公室去  你会看到它在你的办公桌上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what Tag, if we went down to the office, you would see those contracts sitting on your desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我会看到你很窘  因为它不在我的办公桌上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'd see you looking embarrassed because they are not on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.61,0:09:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我很窘  是因为你用裤档接电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or maybe you would see me looking embarrassed because you talk on the phone with your crotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要现在去办公室  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to go to the office now? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  太晚了  我们不去办公室了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, it's late. We're not going down to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  我了解  我也不想被冤枉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I understand. I wouldn't want to be proved wrong either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走  拿外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, get your coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候解开的  好厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! When did you unhook this? Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能再下去了  卡住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It won't go down any further. It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有跳下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. Well, we're just have to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要确定着陆在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yep. Now, we're gonna have to make sure to land...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那块冰的右边  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to the right of that patch of ice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要撞到旁边的垃圾桶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not hit the dumpster on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试着避开中间那棕红色的什么怪东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and uh, and try to avoid that weird brownish-red stuff in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你跳到下面以后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when you get down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:10:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上到屋顶让我进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you go up to the roof and you let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下  要我去  你会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh whoa-whoa. Wait a minute. I have to do it? Yeah! Oh yeah, You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像高空弹跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'll be just like bungee jumping, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不会回弹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But instead of bouncing back up, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我的头撞到水泥地上呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what if I smack my head on the concrete?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我不想骗你  是有这个可能的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm not gonna lie to you, Joey. It's a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  这样吧  掷铜板决定谁去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know Ross! Tell you what, let's flip to see who does it. okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在空中时说出你要的那面  好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You call it in the air, all right? Oh, all right. Tail. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看得到是哪面吗  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you see what it is? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你小心点  罗斯  不  不要这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Well, you be careful. No. No, Ross, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not jumping...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我要试镜  如果摔断腿就不能去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Look, I have an audition tomorrow, and I can't go if I break my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不跳  我有一个儿子  要是我死了他就没爸爸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm not jumping. I have a son. Okay? He won't have a father if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们平手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well all right so, it looks like we're even!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这条线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so this wire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接到这条线  插到这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is connected to this wire, which plugs into here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  让哔声停止  我只要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so to get the beeping to stop, all I have to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做得好  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well done, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要我怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you want from me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的牛奶来了  你想谈什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Here's your milk. What should we talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  你在睡觉吗  抱歉  给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, were you sleeping, sweetie? I'm sorry. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你爱怎么找都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Feel free to look...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我告诉你  那些合约没在这张桌上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I'm telling you those contracts are not on this desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可能知道  你看看有多乱  泰格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh how can you possibly know? Look at this mess, Tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我说的  你一定要有组织一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, This is what I'm talking about. You have to be more organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有报纸  有杂志  你啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've got newspapers, you've got magazines, you-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这小妞是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And who's this chippy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说太幼稚一点吧   随便啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little young for you, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It’s my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  牙套好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Very cute braces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  重点是  泰格  开始找吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, you know what? The point is, Tag, start looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会在你桌上找到那些合约的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because you're gonna find those contracts on your desk.
