Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下午  塞纳先生午餐后  进来我办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the afternoon. Mr. Zelner came into my office after lunch...
