Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你继续找  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you just keep looking in there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Puzzler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bit of a puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去复印室找一找  也许你放在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you check the copy room? Maybe the contracts are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能放在那里  我不知道  泰格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could I have left them in the copy room? I don't know Tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的私处怎么可能打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can your genitals make phone calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  这不是个完美的世界  请你去找一找\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? It's not a perfect world. Just go, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还醒着吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道说话的是我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do know that was me that just said that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们都醒着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As long as we're both up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你不是想要打扫客厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope you're not thinking about cleaning the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿死了  晚饭时我在想什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I'm starving. What the hell was I thinking at dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你要汤还是沙拉"  两样都要  永远都两样都要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Do you want soup or salad?" Both, always order both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看了半天  我想没人在家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I'm looking, and I don't think anyone's home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们打碎窗户\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I say we just break the window...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爬进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...crawl through...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后再解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you know, explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确定  没人在家   我想是没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Really? No one's home? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你进去之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when you get in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你我该在这里分手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. This is where you and I part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死人的贱货\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Noisy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道刚刚发生什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们做爱  然后睡着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. We had sex and then we fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们做了一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. We were in the middle of sex...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你睡着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  没有这回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  这是最棒的一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, best time ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你震撼了我的世界\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You rock my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  怎么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我表现最好的时候  你却错过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was giving you some of my best moves, and you missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你醒来  我们来好好做完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So please wake up so we can do it right.
