Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  大哥  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, big fella. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好表现吧  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me the good stuff. Yeah.
