Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大概不会把咖啡粉洒了一地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I probably won't spill coffee grounds all over the kitchen floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我起来了  我起来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm up. I'm up.
