Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到东西了没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you got anything for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有  我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still no luck. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有检查过整个桌子和所有的抽屉吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you check your entire desk and all the drawers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我再找一次  请你再找一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Want me to check again? Well yeah, I wish you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, no, it's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个抽屉呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about that drawer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不在  有可能在你办公室吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's not out here. Any chance it could be in your office?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找找看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, let me check.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请进来说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I see you in my office for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会偷笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not even gonna gloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很安慰这整件事  你放在我桌上的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just really relieved it's-You put these on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did not. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它从你最下面的抽屉溜出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're saying they just slid out of your bottom drawer...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爬过地板  跳到我桌上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...crawled across the floor, then jumped onto my desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道它在我最下面的抽屉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did you know they were in my bottom drawer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此刻我令你欲火焚身\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so hot for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你怎么又回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! How did you get back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比布非\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe Buffay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警报器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fire Alarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  救火员先生  有什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hi, Officer Fireman. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在垃圾桶发现你的警报器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We found your fire alarm in the trash chute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的  是你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not mine. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次你丢掉警报器时  不要用写着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The next time you want to dump a fire alarm in a trash chute, don't wrap it in a blanket that says:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"菲比布非财物  不是摩妮卡的"的毯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Property of Phoebe Buffay, not Monica."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有搜查令吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay do you—Okay, do you have a search warrant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我查过了  这里还是美国\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because the last time I checked, this was still America.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请把它装回去  折除它是违法的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please reattach it. It's against the law to disconnect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  拜托告诉我  怎样才能让它不叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. But please, God, tell me how to stop it from going off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,压下重设的按钮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a reset button under the plastic cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.21,0:18:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有重设按钮  谢谢  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a reset button? Oh, thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有重设按钮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. There's a reset button?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么没看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't I see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重设按钮  重设按钮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Reset button. Reset button.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重设按钮在哪里  哦  在这里喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where is there a reset button? Oh, here it is! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你抓好了吗  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you have a good grip? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要开始从你这爬过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm gonna start to climb down you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  快点  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, just hurry up. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该面向你爬下来  所以我们面对面的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now-now-now, should I climb down your front so we're face to face...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是应该背对你爬下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or should I climb down your back so we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后屁股对着脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...butt to face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.31,0:19:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面对面  我喜欢面对面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Face to face. I like face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here I come. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:20:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  罗斯  你多重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my-How much do you weigh, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想回答  过节时胖的还没瘦下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I prefer not to answer that right now. I'm still carrying a little holiday weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说要面对面时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, When we talked about face to face...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们没有想清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I don't think we thought it all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我怎么办  从我身上滑下  跳下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what do you want me to do? Just shimmy down me and drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我该吊着  你爬过我下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, maybe I should hang, and you should climb down me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  也许我们应该多讨论一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Maybe we should talk about that for a little while!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来还好远  没有那么远  跳就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It still looks pretty far. It's not that far. Just drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要催我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do not rush me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的裤子开始下滑  我没穿内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you should know that my pants are starting to come down, and I'm not wearing any underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的脚踝  我伤到我的脚踝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow! My ankle! I really hurt my ankle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我扭到了  这里有个硬币\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I twisted it when-Ooh, a quarter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是你的最佳表现啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That really was some of your best work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不能相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩两小时我就要打电话请假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've only got two hours until I call in sick for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我7分钟后就要起床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to be up in seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.37,0:21:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会相信的  如果你还有7分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you're not gonna believe this, but if you have seven minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去拿吸尘器  我拿家具打亮剂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You get the vacuum cleaner. I'll get the furniture polish.
